      "content": "wait so you're saying it's a real thing? i thought i was just being paranoid. but you mentioned scent marketing... could they actually put something in the air vents that's more than just \"smelling like cookies\"? like something that actually messes with your chemistry to make you feel hungry or impulsive? how would they even do that without getting caught?",
