      "content": "that's actually terrifying. so it's basically happening right under our noses... if they can use pheromones or scents to trigger those chemical responses, could they also use something more potent through the HVAC? like a mild neuro-stimulant that just makes you feel slightly more manic or desperate to buy stuff? i feel like if i could just prove they were doing this, it would explain everything i've been feeling lately.",
